<import src="../../templates/patient-results.wxml"/>
<view class="page"><view class="page-heading"><view class="title">{{isDetail?'医疗授权详情':'医疗授权与代理事项'}}</view><view class="subtitle">查看核验结果、有效范围及办理历史。</view></view><template is="patient-results" data="{{busy, error, requestId, done}}"/><view class="notice">仅办理独立核验范围内的医疗事项。预约、完整病历与账单权限分别核对。</view><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="section-title">{{item.patient}} · {{item.kind}}</view><view class="pill">{{item.status_label}}</view><view class="line">{{item.clinic}}</view><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open" disabled="{{busy}}">查看授权范围与办理历史</button></view><block wx:if="{{medical}}"><view class="card"><view class="section-title">{{medical.patient}} · {{medical.kind}}</view><view class="pill">{{medical.status_label}}</view><view class="line">{{medical.clinic}}</view><view wx:if="{{medical.status_only}}" class="notice">请联系核验门店继续办理。资料待核对或权限结束时，只显示办理状态。</view><block wx:if="{{!medical.status_only}}"><view>材料 V{{medical.version_number}} · 方案 {{medical.plan}}</view><view>代理人 {{medical.delegate_name}} · 账号 {{medical.delegate}}</view><view>身份材料 {{medical.identity_reference}}</view><view>代理依据 {{medical.authority_reference}}</view><view class="history">{{medical.applicability}}</view><view>{{medical.fromLabel}} 至 {{medical.untilLabel}}（北京时间）</view><button wx:if="{{medical.can_select}}" bindtap="plan" disabled="{{busy}}">选择此就诊人并办理授权步骤</button></block></view><view wx:if="{{!medical.status_only}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">办理历史</view><view wx:for="{{medical.history}}" wx:key="id" class="line"><view>{{item.state}} · 材料 V{{item.version}}</view><view class="history">{{item.note}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.timeLabel}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!readOnly && !medical.status_only && !preview && medical.state!=='REVOKED' && medical.state!=='REJECTED'}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">明确撤销／放弃本项授权</view><label for="medical-note">撤销原因</label><textarea id="medical-note" value="{{note}}" maxlength="1000" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy||uncertain}}"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="preview" disabled="{{busy||uncertain}}">预览撤销</button></view></block><view wx:if="{{preview}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">核对要撤销的医疗授权</view><view>{{medical.patient}} · {{medical.clinic}} · 办理单 {{medical.id}}</view><view>原医疗决定和业务历史保留。</view><checkbox-group bindchange="checked"><label><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{checked}}" disabled="{{busy||uncertain}}"/>已核对患者及本次撤销范围</label></checkbox-group><view wx:if="{{uncertain}}" class="notice">刚才结果尚未确认，可重试同一提交；勿新建同一申请。</view><button class="danger" bindtap="confirm" disabled="{{busy}}">{{uncertain?'重试核对原提交':'明确撤销此项授权'}}</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="cancel" disabled="{{busy||uncertain}}">返回核对</button></view><view wx:if="{{!busy&&!error&&!rows.length&&!medical&&!done}}" class="notice">暂无医疗代理办理单。请由核验诊所前台受理独立材料。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="subjects" disabled="{{busy}}">选择其他就诊人</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="onShow" disabled="{{busy}}">查询授权状态</button><view class="patient-return"><button class="secondary" bindtap="back" disabled="{{busy}}">{{isDetail?'返回医疗授权清单':'返回我的'}}</button></view></view>
